3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_MAG_PHB_ScimitarOfSpeed_BonusAttack</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_PHB_ScimitarOfSpeed_BonusAttack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_PHB_ScimitarOfSpeed_BonusAttack\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsAttack_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsAttack (spell flag)\">IsAttack</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Belm\" title=\"Belm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Belm\" title=\"Belm\">Belm</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Perfectly Balanced Strike is a variation of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm\" title=\"Dueller's Enthusiasm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp/20px-Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp/30px-Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp/40px-Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dueller's Enthusiasm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp/20px-Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dueller%27s_Enthusiasm\" title=\"Dueller's Enthusiasm\">Dueller's Enthusiasm</a>, allowing the wielder to make an \"offhand-like\" attack with Belm while it is in their main hand. The difference is that there are no restrictions on <a href=\"/wiki/Belm\" title=\"Belm\">Belm's</a> variation – shields and offhand weapons do not disable the weapon action.</li>\n<li>When Belm is equipped in the <i>offhand</i>, Perfectly Balanced Strike functions as an additional <i>main-hand</i> weapon attack. This attack uses all the stats and on-hit effects of the equipped main-hand weapon, including adding the wielder's ability modifier to the damage without the need of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/20px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/30px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/40px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/20px-Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Two-Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\">Two-Weapon Fighting</a>. This effect mimics how additional attacks worked in Baldur's Gate 1 and 2 which used AD&amp;D (i.e., 2e) rules.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043437\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3088/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40915/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13593/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1531802/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.559      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   66.559      1 -total\n 84.18%   56.032     41 Template:Trim\n 17.57%   11.697      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 17.00%   11.315      2 Template:Item_icon\n 11.44%    7.611      5 Template:Icon_text\n  9.54%    6.350      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.46%    6.294      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.47%    5.635      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n  8.22%    5.471      2 Template:SmSAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9176-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715043437 and revision id 381762. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}